(Japanese: '''本当は怖い? ポケモンを知る''' ''Is It Really Scary? Know the Pokémon'') is a {{pkmn|4Koma}} {{pkmn|manga}} created by 山下たかひろ [[Takahiro Yamashita]]. It is available online on the Japanese [http://www.pokemon.jp/special/kowapoke/manga/ Ghost Pokémon] official web page. {{p|Gengar}}, {{p|Misdreavus}}, {{p|Sableye}}, {{p|Cofagrigus}}, {{p|Drifloon}}, {{p|Litwick}}, {{p|Lampent}}, {{p|Pumpkaboo}}, and {{p|Banette}} are each featured in their own four-panel comic strip, with Gengar having two.

